{"id":"ferl1rrguud9k2oypa8ee21zm","title":"彼得·舒夫：比特币崩盘时应尽快离场","originalTitle":"Peter Schiff on the Bitcoin Crash: “Get the Hell Out”","summary":"彼得·舒夫认为，当市场无法在最佳消息下上涨时，通常预示着下跌。他指出比特币缺乏内在价值和分红，大量供应掌握在ETF投资者和比特币储备公司手中，这些资金将很快撤离，导致市场快速下跌。舒夫警告称，即使长期支持者在杠杆投机者退出后也会有更便宜的入场机会，但现在不是持有比特币的时候。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Bitcoin Magazine"},"links":{"original":"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/peter-schiff-on-the-bitcoin-crash-get-the-hell-out"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T20:15:28.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T21:42:57.097Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T21:42:57.097Z","category":"opinion","tags":["合作","比特币"],"score":32,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Patrick Green","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}